BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:48183e296f0fb7a0@role-real-estate-title.maine-government-feeds
DTSTAMP:20260826T200223Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260826
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Safe Homes Awareness Month - September
DESCRIPTION:WHEREAS\n\, the 130th Maine Legislature unanimously passed L.D
 . 1861\, An Act to Establish the Safe Homes Program\, and as Governor\, I 
 signed the bill into law on April 7\, 2022\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, this biparti
 san law promotes the safe storage of prescription drugs\, firearms and oth
 er dangerous weapons in homes or public spaces\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, the Safe
  Homes Program is an optional\, voluntary grant program that builds on the
  work of L.D. 1140\, An Act To Establish a Sales Tax Exemption for the Pur
 chase of Firearm Safety Devices\, by making storage devices\, such as gun 
 safes\, more affordable for people who want to buy them\; and\nWHEREAS\n\,
  the Safe Homes Program Fund will provide grants for purchasing safety dev
 ices for the safe storage of prescription drugs\, firearms\, and dangerous
  weapons in homes or public spaces\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, according to a repor
 t by the U.S. CDC\, there were 181 deaths by firearms in the State of Main
 e in 2024\, with over 86 percent of the deaths the result of suicide\; and
 \nWHEREAS\n\, in 2025\, there were 390 confirmed and suspected fatal drug 
 overdoses\, 20.4 percent lower than the total confirmed fatal overdoses fo
 r 2024\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, by ensuring that firearms and prescription drugs
  are properly stored and secured\, this law will reduce accidental gun dea
 ths\, prevent suicide\, and improve public health\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, in ac
 cordance with 1 MRSA § 150-R\, the month of September of each year is des
 ignated as Safe Homes Awareness Month to raise awareness of the importance
  of safety in the home and the assistance that is available through the Sa
 fe Homes Program established in Title 25\, section 7001\;\nNOW\, THEREFORE
 \n\, be it resolved that I\, Janet T. Mills\, Governor of the State of Mai
 ne\, do hereby proclaim September 2026 as\nSafe Homes Awareness Month\nthr
 oughout the State of Maine\, and I urge all citizens to recognize this obs
 ervance\, promote the proper storage of prescription drugs and firearms\, 
 and learn more about the assistance available through the Safe Homes Progr
 am.\nI\nhttp://www.maine.gov/governor/mills/official_documents/proclamatio
 ns/2026-08-safe-homes-awareness-month-september
URL:http://www.maine.gov/governor/mills/official_documents/proclamations/2
 026-08-safe-homes-awareness-month-september
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
